WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.300
Auckland importers have started asking AI

2
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.610
who should store and ship their stock.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.250
We asked ChatGPT and Google's AI

4
00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:14.800
ten of those questions, three times each.

5
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.960
MOVe was named in 14 answers out of 82.

6
00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:19.950
Who devans containers in Auckland?

7
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:21.540
Who has pallet storage?

8
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:23.820
Who picks and packs for online stores?

9
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.120
Not one answer named MOVe.

10
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.350
NZ Devanning, Store Rite and Online Distribution

11
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.110
were named instead.

12
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.050
Ask which companies have warehouses in East Tāmaki,

13
00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.430
and MOVe is named every time.

14
00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.510
So AI knows where Highbrook is.

15
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.230
It just doesn't know what Highbrook does.

16
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:42.850
Eko Media fixes that.

17
00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.530
A new Highbrook page.

18
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.010
Guides that answer the questions buyers ask.

19
00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.780
A video and posts that all point back to them.

20
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.850
And every month, we ask the questions again,

21
00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:54.840
and show you what changed.

22
00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:56.650
Scan the code,

23
00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:58.550
or get in touch with Freddie at Eko Media.
